To make those two schedule override options sit side-by-side horizontally, we need to change the <Stack> direction to "row" and give each option a flex: 1 property so they split the available space equally. We also need to remove the left margin (ml: 4) from the date picker box below it, as that indentation no longer makes sense with a horizontal layout.
Here is the exact code replacement for your VoucherAuthorization.jsx file.
